Accept: application/json

###

### List RDS instances without encryption at rest by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rds/unencrypted-instances?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### List RDS instances without adequate automated backups by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rds/no-backups?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### List IAM access keys
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/iam/access-keys
Accept: application/json

###

