GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/iam/admin-privilege-grants
Accept: application/json

###

### List IAM roles with cross-account or wildcard trust policies
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/iam/cross-account-roles
Accept: application/json

###

### Root account security status (MFA, access keys, signing certs)
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/iam/root-account-status
Accept: application/json

###

### List IAM inline policies for users, groups and roles
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/iam/inline-policies
Accept: application/json

###

### List IAM customer policies with overprivileged permissions
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/iam/overprivileged-custom-policies
Accept: application/json

###

### Security summary scorecard by region
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/security/summary?region=us-east-1&days=30
Accept: application/json

###

### Internet-facing load balancers with public listener risks
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/elb/public-listeners?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### ECR repositories with public access or scan-on-push disabled
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ecr/repository-risks?region=us-east-1
Accept: application/json

###

### Costs grouped by project tag (inclusive date range)
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cost/by-project?startDate=2026-05-01&endDate=2026-05-31
Accept: application/json

###

### Inspector vulnerabilities by region (optional filters: resourceType, severity, status)
GET {{AwsApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/inspector/vulnerabilities?region=us-east-1&resourceType=ec2&severity=HIGH&status=ACTIVE
Accept: application/json

